    "sections": {
        "description": "Travern is a modern and responsive travel WordPress theme designed for travel agencies, tour operators, tourism websites, and travel bloggers. It comes with beautifully designed sections to showcase tour packages, destinations, services, testimonials, and blogs, helping you create a professional travel website with ease. Built for performance, Travern is SEO optimized, fast loading, and fully mobile-friendly, ensuring a smooth user experience across all devices. With easy customization options, clean design, and user-friendly layout, Travern is perfect for creating websites related to travel booking, vacation planning, holiday tours, and adventure trips without any coding knowledge. This theme compatible with the latest version of WordPress and plugins like wocommerce and contact form."
    },
